{
  "name": "Fractal Tree",
  "family": "fractal",
  "duration": 30,
  "description": "Recursive binary tree - low-fidelity graphic branch-fan in a fixed psychedelic palette, green at the trunk through cyan and violet to magenta at the tips, where every branch level carries its own colour. The tree DANCES: it bounces on every beat and sways across each bar, with the motion rippling outward from the trunk so the fine branches follow a beat behind, and the finest tips wink in and out on the beat with the dance. Underneath it holds ONE size and steps to a new one when a sound lands, so the tree is small in a sparse passage and full in a dense one and still in between. The outer tips spark brighter the moment a sound lands, the canopy opens as the spectrum changes, and the tone deepens with the music's energy.",
